    LLM: "Pick a suit and stick to it. Trade low cards for high ones. Knock if you have >25 points early.\n\nWatch what opponents pick up to guess their suit. If someone picks up a Spade, don't discard high Spades.\n\nDefensive knocking: Knock early to catch opponents with mixed suits, even if your score is mediocre (e.g., 20-22).",
